 "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose fabric, arrange and cut out patterns, sew garments and add decorations. Dressmaker is a cozy simulation game where every part of making a dress is under your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/15a7ddb83ef6f39b068bbebb8ab93c72.avif?t=1789990729\" alt=\"Tactile, real-world dressmaking\" width=730 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether your pattern is aligned to the grain or cut on bias, how you choose to arrange and cut out your fabric is what appears on the final dress. Take full control over what fabric to use for each panel of your garment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/a6923a9924c3772930c848ddbf17a420.poster.avif?t=1789990729\" aria-label=\"A short video showing pattern pieces being cut out of a roll of fabric on a cutting table. The cut fabric is added to the player&#039;s inventory.\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/a6923a9924c3772930c848ddbf17a420.webm?t=1789990729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/a6923a9924c3772930c848ddbf17a420.mp4?t=1789990729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/7493c8e87cc079848b73ebd888a4783f.avif?t=1789990729\" alt=\"A sewing machine with infinite bobbin\" width=730 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your fabric through the sewing machine to stitch it together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/c890fe187d93532c9b859689102b6eea.poster.avif?t=1789990729\" aria-label=\"A short video showing fabric going through a vintage sewing machine\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/c890fe187d93532c9b859689102b6eea.webm?t=1789990729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/c890fe187d93532c9b859689102b6eea.mp4?t=1789990729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/e9c92eca4b27517de2c93c246189373b.avif?t=1789990729\" alt=\"Your own creative sandbox\" width=730 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your dress with buttons, bows and appliqué. Add lace trims and other accessories wherever you like with complete creative freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/c131c8847b03b174c1b17055e22972c0.poster.avif?t=1789990729\" aria-label=\"A short video demonstrating white buttons being placed onto a dress\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/c131c8847b03b174c1b17055e22972c0.webm?t=1789990729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/c131c8847b03b174c1b17055e22972c0.mp4?t=1789990729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/24000ab837673e714c9701061490ec0c.avif?t=1789990729\" alt=\"A dress for every occasion\" width=730 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a whole town of people hoping to fill their wardrobes with custom-made dresses tailored specially to important events and their individual tastes. Create dresses to impress them, or display your own designs in your shop window and sell pre-made dresses off of the rack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/e40ff51d0ab4bb0b4609b299b3b07494.poster.avif?t=1789990729\" aria-label=\"A short video showing a customer entering the store. She says, &amp;quot;Dressmaker! There&#039;s an evening ball at the duke&#039;s - I call him Edmund - Edmund&#039;s mansion. Glamourous? Yes. Elegant? But of course. My budget is 1000.&amp;quot;\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/e40ff51d0ab4bb0b4609b299b3b07494.webm?t=1789990729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/e40ff51d0ab4bb0b4609b299b3b07494.mp4?t=1789990729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy from a wide range of fabrics, including cotton, linen, wool, silk and velvet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and colour your dress in your sketchbook, adding fabric samples and appliqué.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange and cut out your dress pattern, preview them on a mannequin and sew them together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn in your dresses to your customers to gain both reputation and coin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet the kitty.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose fabric, arrange and cut out patterns, sew garments and add decorations. Dressmaker is a cozy simulation game where every part of making a dress is under your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/15a7ddb83ef6f39b068bbebb8ab93c72.avif?t=1789990729\" alt=\"Tactile, real-world dressmaking\" width=730 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether your pattern is aligned to the grain or cut on bias, how you choose to arrange and cut out your fabric is what appears on the final dress. Take full control over what fabric to use for each panel of your garment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/a6923a9924c3772930c848ddbf17a420.poster.avif?t=1789990729\" aria-label=\"A short video showing pattern pieces being cut out of a roll of fabric on a cutting table. The cut fabric is added to the player&#039;s inventory.\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/a6923a9924c3772930c848ddbf17a420.webm?t=1789990729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/a6923a9924c3772930c848ddbf17a420.mp4?t=1789990729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/7493c8e87cc079848b73ebd888a4783f.avif?t=1789990729\" alt=\"A sewing machine with infinite bobbin\" width=730 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your fabric through the sewing machine to stitch it together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/c890fe187d93532c9b859689102b6eea.poster.avif?t=1789990729\" aria-label=\"A short video showing fabric going through a vintage sewing machine\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/c890fe187d93532c9b859689102b6eea.webm?t=1789990729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/c890fe187d93532c9b859689102b6eea.mp4?t=1789990729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/e9c92eca4b27517de2c93c246189373b.avif?t=1789990729\" alt=\"Your own creative sandbox\" width=730 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your dress with buttons, bows and appliqué. Add lace trims and other accessories wherever you like with complete creative freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/c131c8847b03b174c1b17055e22972c0.poster.avif?t=1789990729\" aria-label=\"A short video demonstrating white buttons being placed onto a dress\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/c131c8847b03b174c1b17055e22972c0.webm?t=1789990729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/c131c8847b03b174c1b17055e22972c0.mp4?t=1789990729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/24000ab837673e714c9701061490ec0c.avif?t=1789990729\" alt=\"A dress for every occasion\" width=730 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a whole town of people hoping to fill their wardrobes with custom-made dresses tailored specially to important events and their individual tastes. Create dresses to impress them, or display your own designs in your shop window and sell pre-made dresses off of the rack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/e40ff51d0ab4bb0b4609b299b3b07494.poster.avif?t=1789990729\" aria-label=\"A short video showing a customer entering the store. She says, &amp;quot;Dressmaker! There&#039;s an evening ball at the duke&#039;s - I call him Edmund - Edmund&#039;s mansion. Glamourous? Yes. Elegant? But of course. My budget is 1000.&amp;quot;\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/e40ff51d0ab4bb0b4609b299b3b07494.webm?t=1789990729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019220/extras/e40ff51d0ab4bb0b4609b299b3b07494.mp4?t=1789990729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy from a wide range of fabrics, including cotton, linen, wool, silk and velvet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and colour your dress in your sketchbook, adding fabric samples and appliqué.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange and cut out your dress pattern, preview them on a mannequin and sew them together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn in your dresses to your customers to gain both reputation and coin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet the kitty.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>"
